    "title": "Texas vs Gonzaga: Time, TV channel, how to watch March Madness game",
    "text": "After one upset, Texas men's basketball is looking for another.   The Longhorns continue their March Madness journey Saturday against the Gonzaga Bulldogs. The 11th seed in its region, Texas is looking for its first Sweet 16 berth since 2023. First-year coach Sean Miller and the Longhorns beat BYU, 78-71, and Gonzaga topped Kennesaw State, 73-64.  RELATED: AJ Dybantsa got the stats, Dailyn Swain grabbed the win. Could the 2 meet in the NBA? The winner of Saturday's game moves on to face with Miami, Missouri, Purdue or Queens for a shot at the Elite Eight. Here's how to watch Texas play Gonzaga. What time is Texas vs Gonzaga in March Madness? Texas will face Gonzaga at Moda Center in Portland, Ore. at 6:10 p.m. CT Saturday. How to watch Texas vs Gonzaga: TV channel, radio stations The Bulldogs-Longhorns will be nationally broadcast with Brad Nessler, Wally Szczerbiak and Jared Greenberg on the call. TV: TBS Radio: 98.1 FM/1300 AM The Zone Texas vs Gonzaga: Betting odds for NCAA Tournament Moneyline: Gonzaga -260, Texas +210 Spread: Gonzaga by 5.5 points Over/under: 147.5 points",
